 stays on hold\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11573:## D747 · 2026-11-23 · Alex rules that a forecast may rest on an explained indirect comparison\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11592:## D748 · 2026-11-23 · The D747 re-read fails on a self-contradicting floor; three of four earlier splits settle under the ruling; council 63: ask Alex to authorize the E writer repair; the paid re-send stays on hold\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11641:## D749 · 2026-11-23 · Alex authorizes the E writer repair and its $0 writer test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11656:## D750 · 2026-11-23 · The D749 writer test is INCONCLUSIVE with no failed line; council 65 (under D439): one bullet-2 sentence on reaffirmed targets, then a second $0 writer test\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
